@startuml 使用案例2_申請審核作業
title 使用案例3.2: 申請審核作業\n(BP-APPLICATION-005)

actor "送養者\n(一般會員/收容所會員)" as Owner
participant "ApplicationReview.vue" as ReviewPage
participant "applications.ts API" as AppAPI
participant "applications.py" as AppBlueprint
participant "application_service.py" as AppService
participant "permission_service.py" as PermissionService
participant "notification_service.py" as NotificationService
participant "audit_service.py" as AuditService
participant "animal_service.py" as AnimalService
participant "Application Model" as AppModel
participant "Animal Model" as AnimalModel
database "PostgreSQL" as DB

== 1. 進入申請審核頁面 ==
Owner -> ReviewPage: 瀏覽到「領養申請管理」
activate ReviewPage
ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 取得當前用戶\n(authStore.user)
ReviewPage -> AppAPI: getApplications(filters)
activate AppAPI

AppAPI -> AppBlueprint: GET /applications?\nmode=review
activate AppBlueprint
AppBlueprint -> AppBlueprint: 驗證 JWT Token\n取得 current_user_id
AppBlueprint -> AppService: list_applications(current_user, filters)
activate AppService

== 2. 權限過濾申請列表 ==
AppService -> AppService: 判斷用戶角色
note right
  若 user.role == ADMIN:
    查看所有申請
  否則:
    查看針對自己動物的申請
end note

alt mode = 'review' (審核模式)
    AppService -> DB: SELECT animal_id FROM animals\nWHERE owner_id = current_user_id\nOR shelter_id = user.primary_shelter_id
    activate DB
    DB --> AppService: owned_animal_ids[]
    deactivate DB
    
    AppService -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE animal_id IN (owned_animal_ids)\nAND deleted_at IS NULL\nORDER BY created_at DESC
    activate DB
    DB --> AppService: applications[]
    deactivate DB
end

AppService --> AppBlueprint: {items: [...], total, page, pages}
deactivate AppService
AppBlueprint --> AppAPI: applications_response
deactivate AppBlueprint
AppAPI --> ReviewPage: applications_data
deactivate AppAPI

== 3. 顯示申請列表 ==
ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 計算統計資料\n(pending, approved, rejected)
ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 渲染申請卡片列表
ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示申請列表\n及統計資訊
note right
  統計卡片顯示:
  - 待審核數量
  - 審核中數量
  - 已通過數量
  - 已拒絕數量
end note

== 4. 選擇並檢視申請 ==
Owner -> ReviewPage: 點選申請卡片\n或「查看詳情」按鈕
ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 載入申請詳細資料
ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示申請詳情 Modal
note right
  顯示內容:
  - 申請人基本資料
  - 聯絡資訊
  - 居住環境
  - 飼養經驗
  - 領養原因
  - 動物資訊
end note

== 5. 送養者評估申請 ==
Owner -> Owner: 檢視申請人資訊\n評估是否適合領養

== 6. 選擇審核結果 ==
alt 核准申請
    Owner -> ReviewPage: 點選「通過」按鈕
    ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 設定 reviewAction = 'approve'
else 拒絕申請
    Owner -> ReviewPage: 點選「拒絕」按鈕
    ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 設定 reviewAction = 'reject'
end

ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示審核確認 Modal

== 7. 填寫審核意見 ==
Owner -> ReviewPage: 輸入審核備註\n(review_notes)
note right
  核准: 通過的原因或注意事項
  拒絕: 拒絕的原因說明
end note

== 8. 提交審核結果 ==
Owner -> ReviewPage: 點選「確認通過」或「確認拒絕」
activate ReviewPage
ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 驗證審核備註已填寫

ReviewPage -> AppAPI: reviewApplication(applicationId, reviewData)
activate AppAPI
note right of AppAPI
  reviewData = {
    action: 'approve' / 'reject',
    review_notes: '審核意見',
    version: application.version
  }
end note

AppAPI -> AppBlueprint: POST /applications/{id}/review
activate AppBlueprint
AppBlueprint -> AppBlueprint: 驗證 JWT Token
AppBlueprint -> AppService: review_application(\napplicationId, reviewer, action, review_notes, version)
activate AppService

== 9. 權限驗證 ==
AppService -> DB: SELECT * FROM applications\nWHERE application_id = {id}\nAND deleted_at IS NULL
activate DB
DB --> AppService: application
deactivate DB

AppService -> PermissionService: can_review_application(reviewer, application)
activate PermissionService

PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查是否為管理員
note right
  管理員 **不能** 審核申請
  只有送養人可以審核
end note

PermissionService -> DB: SELECT * FROM animals\nWHERE animal_id = application.animal_id
activate DB
DB --> PermissionService: animal
deactivate DB

PermissionService -> PermissionService: 檢查動物歸屬
note right
  若 animal.owner_id == reviewer.user_id:
    個人送養，送養人可審核
  
  若 animal.shelter_id == reviewer.primary_shelter_id:
    收容所動物，收容所成員可審核
  
  否則:
    無權限審核
end note

alt 管理員嘗試審核
    PermissionService --> AppService: raise PermissionDeniedError\n'管理員不能審核申請'
    AppService --> AppBlueprint: PermissionDeniedError
    AppBlueprint --> AppAPI: 403 Forbidden
    AppAPI --> ReviewPage: error
    ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 非動物擁有者
    PermissionService --> AppService: raise PermissionDeniedError\n'只有送養人可以審核此申請'
    AppService --> AppBlueprint: PermissionDeniedError
    AppBlueprint --> AppAPI: 403 Forbidden
    AppAPI --> ReviewPage: error
    ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示錯誤訊息
else 有權限審核
    PermissionService --> AppService: True
    deactivate PermissionService
    
    == 10. 狀態與樂觀鎖驗證 ==
    AppService -> AppService: 檢查申請狀態
    note right
      只能審核 PENDING 或 UNDER_REVIEW 的申請
    end note
    
    alt 狀態不符
        AppService --> AppBlueprint: ValidationError\n'此申請無法審核'
        AppBlueprint --> AppAPI: 400 Bad Request
        AppAPI --> ReviewPage: error
        ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示錯誤訊息
    else 版本衝突 (樂觀鎖)
        AppService -> AppService: 檢查 version == expected_version
        AppService --> AppBlueprint: ConflictError\n'申請已被他人修改'
        AppBlueprint --> AppAPI: 409 Conflict
        AppAPI --> ReviewPage: error
        ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示錯誤訊息\n建議重新載入
    else 驗證通過
        == 11. 更新申請狀態 ==
        alt 核准申請
            AppService -> DB: UPDATE applications\nSET status = 'APPROVED',\nreview_notes = '...',\nreviewed_at = NOW(),\nversion = version + 1
            activate DB
            DB --> AppService: 更新成功
            deactivate DB
            
            == 12. 更新動物狀態為已領養 ==
            AppService -> AnimalService: mark_as_adopted(animal_id)
            activate AnimalService
            AnimalService -> DB: UPDATE animals\nSET status = 'ADOPTED'
            activate DB
            DB --> AnimalService: 更新成功
            deactivate DB
            AnimalService --> AppService: animal updated
            deactivate AnimalService
            
            note right
              核准後動物不會出現在公開清單
              status: PUBLISHED → ADOPTED
            end note
            
        else 拒絕申請
            AppService -> DB: UPDATE applications\nSET status = 'REJECTED',\nreview_notes = '...',\nreviewed_at = NOW(),\nversion = version + 1
            activate DB
            DB --> AppService: 更新成功
            deactivate DB
        end
        
        == 13. 記錄審計日誌 ==
        AppService -> AuditService: log_application_review(\napplication, action, reviewer)
        activate AuditService
        AuditService -> DB: INSERT INTO audit_logs
        activate DB
        DB --> AuditService: log_id
        deactivate DB
        AuditService --> AppService: 審計記錄已建立
        deactivate AuditService
        
        == 14. 通知申請人 ==
        AppService -> NotificationService: notify_application_reviewed(\napplication, action, review_notes)
        activate NotificationService
        NotificationService -> DB: INSERT INTO notifications\n(recipient_id = applicant_id)
        activate DB
        DB --> NotificationService: notification_id
        deactivate DB
        
        NotificationService -> NotificationService: 發送 Email 通知\n(如已啟用)
        note right
          通知內容:
          - 審核結果 (通過/拒絕)
          - 動物名稱
          - 審核備註
        end note
        
        NotificationService --> AppService: 通知已發送
        deactivate NotificationService
        
        AppService --> AppBlueprint: {application: {...}}
        deactivate AppService
        AppBlueprint --> AppAPI: 200 OK {message, application}
        deactivate AppBlueprint
        AppAPI --> ReviewPage: 審核成功
        deactivate AppAPI
        
        == 15. 更新前端顯示 ==
        ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 更新申請狀態\n(本地狀態更新)
        ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 更新統計資料
        ReviewPage -> ReviewPage: 關閉審核 Modal
        ReviewPage --> Owner: 顯示成功訊息\n「申請已{核准/拒絕}」
        deactivate ReviewPage
        
        note over Owner, DB
          **後置條件:**
          1. 申請狀態已更新 (APPROVED / REJECTED)
          2. 若核准，動物狀態變為 ADOPTED
          3. 審計日誌已記錄
          4. 申請人已收到通知
          5. 動物不再出現在公開清單 (如已核准)
        end note
    end
end

@enduml
